  IncidentDetails:
    isNegative: 0
    incidentName: Singing Pilgrims
    chanceToHappen: 15
    incidentDescription: "The sounds of ringing bells and strange singing can be
      heard long before you can see the foreign group of travelers. As they grow
      close they hail your caravan and approach. They are religious pilgrims spreading
      cheer and charity, they say. Whilst you can\u2019t speak to their musical taste,
      you are not one to turn down freely given goods.  The pilgrims eventually carry
      on their way, the singing growing quieter and quieter and your caravan is left
      with an addition of tasty flat breads and preserved meats. "
